-- refusals --
truncated bad_request: the multipart body ended before its closing boundary
no-disposition bad_request: a multipart part carries no Content-Disposition
no-name bad_request: a multipart part carries no field name
no-colon bad_request: a multipart part header has no colon
empty-header-name bad_request: a multipart part header has an empty name
too-many-parts payload_too_large: the multipart body carries more than 2 parts
part-too-big payload_too_large: a multipart part exceeds the 4-byte limit
total-too-big payload_too_large: the multipart body exceeds the 6-byte total limit
filename-too-long payload_too_large: a submitted filename is longer than 4 bytes
field-name-too-long payload_too_large: a multipart field name is longer than 2 bytes
headers-too-big payload_too_large: a multipart part's headers exceed 20 bytes
too-many-headers payload_too_large: a multipart part carries more than 2 headers
type-allowed head[name=f file=true filename=a.png type=image/png; charset=binary headers=2] body[P] done[1] finished[1]
type-refused unsupported_media_type: a file part declares 'application/x-msdownload', which this endpoint does not accept
